      ],
      "source": "https://traveloregon.com/things-to-do/culture-history/oregon-tribal-spotlight-warm-springs/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community of Warm Springs is situated in the valley of Shitike Creek at an elevation of over fifteen hundred feet.",
